<section class="cth-faq" id="faq">
  <div class="page-width">
    <h2>Good questions, honest answers</h2>
    <details><summary>Which size should I get?</summary><p>Medium is 24 x 31 in and suits cats and small dogs who curl up. Large is 31 x 35 in for medium pets, larger pets, or any pet who likes to sprawl.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How do I wash it?</summary><p>Machine wash the whole bed cold on a gentle cycle, then air-dry or tumble low. There is no removable zip cover.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Will my anxious pet actually use it?</summary><p>Many pets settle into raised, soft edges because they feel protected. Add a familiar blanket or toy for the first night to help them claim the spot, and use the 30-night trial to make sure it is right for them.</p></details>
    <details><summary>When will it arrive?</summary><p>Orders are processed within 1-2 business days and typically arrive within the standard US delivery window shown at checkout. You will get a tracking link by email as soon as it ships.</p></details>
    <details><summary>What's your return policy?</summary><p>If it is not the cozy upgrade you hoped for, reach out within 30 nights for help with a return.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

